          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Avoid Free Tablet Scams</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">Be careful with websites that ask for unusual fees, promise instant or guaranteed approval, claim everyone gets a free iPad, use fake government branding, or pressure you to submit personal information fast.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">ACP and EBB are no longer active benefit routes for new tablet help. Before applying, verify current Lifeline, provider, state, nonprofit, school, library, VA, or local digital inclusion options, then read co-pay, shipping, service, data, and activation details.</p>
